[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0341","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0341.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-50967","title":"latchset jose 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"latchset jose 库（版本 11 及之前）在处理 JWE 加密中的 PBES2 密钥管理时存在资源消耗漏洞。攻击者可构造包含超大 p2c（PBES2 Count）值的恶意 JWE 令牌，当服务端解析该令牌时，会因执行大量 PBES2 迭代计算而导致 CPU 耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 latchset jose 库解析 JWE 令牌的应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-50967"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-03-20T16:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:40:20Z","remediation":"立即将 latchset jose 升级至 v13 及以上版本（v13 在 2025 年 4 月发布，通过限制 p2c 最大迭代次数为 32768 修复了该 DoS 漏洞）。若为 Fedora 发行版用户，可通过 `sudo dnf update jose` 安装对应包更新。临时缓解措施：在应用层对 JWE 解析时的 p2c 字段做上限校验，拒绝 p2c 大于 32768 的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/P3ngu1nW/CVE_Request/blob/main/latch-jose.md","https://github.com/latchset/jose","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/CIFPQUCLNWEAHYYJWCQD3AZPWYIV6YT3/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/OOBFVMOAV732C7PY74AHJ62ZNKT3ISZ6/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/W7EGLOAFN2PWZ75ZRLTUDUZCIPH2VFZU/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/CIFPQUCLNWEAHYYJWCQD3AZPWYIV6YT3/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/OOBFVMOAV732C7PY74AHJ62ZNKT3ISZ6/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/W7EGLOAFN2PWZ75ZRLTUDUZCIPH2VFZU/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-50967.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/50xxx/CVE-2023-50967.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-50967.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-50967","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/50xxx/CVE-2023-50967.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-50967-2025-11-04-1620","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-50967.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2024/03/GHSA-5rrv-52wj-qgfg/GHSA-5rrv-52wj-qgfg.json","https://github.com/altlinux/specs/blob/1be3fc1d3ed93b5779c5ac0f863c52c6b251b557/j/jose/jose.spec","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2023-50967"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2023/POC-AVE-2023-0341.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2023/EXP-AVE-2023-0341.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0341.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0415","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-6270","title":"Linux 内核 ATA over Ethernet (AoE) 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ATA over Ethernet (AoE) 驱动中存在释放后使用 (Use-After-Free) 漏洞，源于 `aoecmd_cfg_pkts()` 函数对 `struct net_device` 的引用计数更新不当。本地攻击者可通过竞态条件在结构体释放后通过 `skbtxq` 全局队列访问已释放内存，导致系统拒绝服务或潜在代码执行。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2023-6270"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2024-01-04T17:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:50:25Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.9 或更高版本，其中包含上游提交 f98364e926626c 的修复。对于 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 6/7，安装 Red Hat 提供的对应内核安全更新。Debian 10 用户应用 2024 年 6 月发布的 LTS 内核更新。如无法立即升级且未使用 AoE 设备，可临时通过 blacklist aoe 内核模块或卸载 aoe 驱动防止漏洞利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2023-6270","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2256786","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2024/06/msg00017.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2024/06/msg00020.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2023/CVE-2023-6270.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2023/6xxx/CVE-2023-6270.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-6270.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2023/6xxx/CVE-2023-6270.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-6270","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-6270.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/3c0945e34109d51978c088d0e68eb6af7923c4f4/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-kernel/linux/cve-exclusion.inc","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-6270.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-6270.md","https://github.com/davidwowa/tech.cybersword.scm/blob/9f9c8b8f3096e9ea4ebdd18591194da9280c6375/tex/backup/202502102221/CVE-2023-6270.tex"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0119","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0119.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"江苏迈威安全生产数字化管理平台任意文件上传漏洞","description":"安全生产数字化管理平台的文件上传功能存在未授权访问缺陷，未对上传文件类型、名称和内容进行有效限制，导致远程攻击者可通过上传恶意脚本文件（如aspx）并解析执行，直接获取服务器控制权限。攻击者无需任何认证即可利用此漏洞，危害较大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2023-CNVD-2023-96945-YAML","CNVD-2023-96945"],"sources":["nuclei","cnvd"],"published":"2023-12-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"在服务端对上传文件进行类型白名单校验，只允许指定安全类型文件上传；使用随机化重命名方式存储文件，避免使用原始文件名；对上传文件内容进行恶意代码扫描检测；将上传目录权限设置为最小化，禁止脚本解析执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T23:09:28Z","references":["https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_42628854/article/details/136036109","https://www.cnvd.org.cn/flaw/show/CNVD-2023-96945"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0114","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0114.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"杭州阔知网络科技 EduSoho 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"EduSoho 网络教学系统 v22.4.7 及之前版本存在未授权任意文件读取漏洞，攻击者通过 /export/classroom-course-statistics 接口的 fileNames[] 参数构造路径遍历 payload，可直接读取服务器敏感文件。成功利用可获取 config/parameters.yml 配置文件中的 secret 密钥及数据库账号密码，结合 Symfony 框架 _fragment 路由特性进一步实现远程代码执行，导致服务器完全沦陷。漏洞利用无需认证，仅需目标运行受影响版本 EduSoho 且接口可达即可触发，影响范围覆盖大量在线教育平台部署环境。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-CNVD-2023-CNVD-2023-03903-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2023-12-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2023-12-15T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 EduSoho 至 v22.4.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 classroom-course-statistics 接口的路径遍历问题。如无法立即升级，在 WAF/Nginx 层添加规则拦截对 /export/classroom-course-statistics 的请求中 fileNames[] 参数包含 ../ 的路径穿越 payload，同时限制该接口仅允许已认证管理员访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.csdn.net/qq_41904294/article/details/135007351","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/master/CNVD-2023-03903.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0413","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0413.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-6174","title":"Wireshark SSH 解析器越界读取漏洞","description":"Wireshark 4.0.0 至 4.0.10 版本的 SSH 协议解析器存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125）。攻击者可通过向网络中注入特制数据包或诱导用户打开恶意构造的捕获文件触发该漏洞，导致 SSH 解析器崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本 Wireshark 的所有平台，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。用户应升级至 Wireshark 4.0.11 或更高版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2023-6174"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-11-16T12:15:07Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:50:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Wireshark 至 4.0.11 或更高版本（3.6.x 用户升级至 3.6.19+），该漏洞在 SSH 解析器中存在越界读取，攻击者可通过注入恶意数据包或诱导打开特制抓包文件触发崩溃。Debian 用户可参考 DSA-5559、Gentoo 用户参考 GLSA 202402-09 安装对应安全更新。如无法立即升级，避免在 Wireshark 中打开来源不可信的 pcap 文件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/19369","https://www.wireshark.org/security/wnpa-sec-2023-28.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/34DBP5P2RHQ7XUABPANYYMOGV5KS6VEP/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/MADSCHKZSCKQ5NLIX3UMOIJD2JZ65L4V/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202402-09","https://www.debian.org/security/2023/dsa-5559","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-6174.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2023/6xxx/CVE-2023-6174.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-6174.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/active/CVE-2023-6174","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/wireshark/wireshark.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/6xxx/CVE-2023-6174.json","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-6174.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/d835502983c744c84cf033713a5978c1178bffab/community/wireshark/APKBUILD","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-6174.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-6174"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0413.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0002","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-46747","title":"F5 BIG-IP TMUI 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"F5 BIG-IP 的 TMUI（流量管理用户界面）存在身份认证绕过漏洞，源于配置实用程序对特定请求的认证校验不完善，CWE-288/CWE-306。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过管理端口或自 IP 地址向目标系统发送特制请求绕过认证，直接执行任意系统命令，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个 BIG-IP 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害严重。F5 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，用户应升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-46747"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2023-10-26T21:15:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:31:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至以下修复版本：BIG-IP 13.1.x 升级至 13.1.5.1，14.1.x 升级至 14.1.5.6，15.1.x 升级至 15.1.10.2，16.1.x 升级至 16.1.4.1，17.1.x 升级至 17.1.1 或安装热补丁 Hotfix-BIGIP-17.1.0.3.0.75.4。临时缓解措施：通过 ACL 限制仅允许可信 IP 地址访问管理端口和自 IP 地址上的 TMUI 配置界面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/175673/F5-BIG-IP-TMUI-AJP-Smuggling-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://my.f5.com/manage/s/article/K000137353","https://www.secpod.com/blog/f5-issues-warning-big-ip-vulnerability-used-in-active-exploit-chain/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2023-46747","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2023/CVE-2023-46747.yaml","https://github.com/W01fh4cker/CVE-2023-46747-RCE","https://github.com/AliBrTab/CVE-2023-46747-POC","https://github.com/nvansluis/test_cve-2023-46747","https://github.com/Razzlemouse/F5-BIG-IP-SmuggleShell-CVE-2023-46747-Exploit","https://github.com/RevoltSecurities/CVE-2023-46747","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-46747"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2023/POC-AVE-2023-0002.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0337","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0337.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-31096","title":"Broadcom LSI PCI-SV92EX Soft Modem 内核驱动程序权限提升漏洞","description":"Broadcom LSI PCI-SV92EX Soft Modem 内核驱动程序（AGRSM64.sys）2.2.100.1 及之前版本中存在栈溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向驱动程序发送特制的 IOCTL 0x1b2150 请求触发 RTLCopyMemory 中的缓冲区溢出，将权限从中等完整性提升至 SYSTEM 级。该漏洞可被用于 BYOVD 勒索软件攻击，绕过内核级防护（如杀毒软件或 PPL 保护），CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。建议用户禁用或移除受影响驱动程序。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-31096"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-10-10T19:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:56:17Z","remediation":"该驱动 (AGRSM64.sys) 已自 2016 年起终止支持，Broadcom 不会发布补丁。建议立即卸载该驱动（若无需使用该调制解调器硬件），或使用 Microsoft 内核驱动的 HVCI（内存完整性）及 WDAC（Windows Defender 应用程序控制）功能阻止 AGRSM64.sys 加载；同时确保安装最新的 Windows 安全更新以获取 Microsoft 易受攻击驱动程序阻止列表的更新，防止 BYOVD 攻击利用该驱动进行权限提升。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cschwarz1.github.io/posts/0x04/","https://www.broadcom.com","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-31096.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/31xxx/CVE-2023-31096.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/31xxx/CVE-2023-31096.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2023-31096","https://github.com/splintersfury/KernelSight/blob/c4101ef9174b083b99cf79d99e0c61308bb26f06/docs/case-studies/CVE-2023-31096.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2023/10/GHSA-6hxc-fm22-74v5/GHSA-6hxc-fm22-74v5.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/13/seguranca/cve-2023-31096-mitre-cve-2023-31096-windows-agere--1768291200000.md","https://github.com/demisto/content/blob/d98d30250b79e8add010b07b0ecefb3cd85a3ee4/Packs/PaloAltoNetworks_DeviceSecurity/Integrations/PaloAltoNetworks_DeviceSecurity/README.md","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2023-31096","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-31096.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0337.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0003","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-4966","title":"Citrix NetScaler ADC/Gateway 敏感信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Citrix NetScaler ADC 和 NetScaler Gateway 存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（Citrix Bleed），当设备被配置为网关（VPN 虚拟服务器、ICA 代理、CVPN、RDP 代理）或 AAA 虚拟服务器时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制请求触发内存越界读取，泄露已登录用户的会话令牌（Session Token），进而劫持合法会话实现未授权访问。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重，影响 Citrix ADC 和 Gateway 多个版本，且已在野外被广泛利用。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2023-4966"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2023-10-10T14:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:38:59Z","remediation":"立即将 NetScaler ADC 和 NetScaler Gateway 升级至以下安全版本：14.1-8.50及以上、13.1-49.15及以上、13.0-92.19及以上、13.1-FIPS-37.164及以上、12.1-FIPS-55.300及以上、12.1-NDcPP-55.300及以上。升级后须立即终止所有活跃会话和持久会话，防止已泄露的会话令牌被继续利用。如无法立即升级，可将受影响设备从公网隔离或限制源IP访问管理接口作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/175323/Citrix-Bleed-Session-Token-Leakage-Proof-Of-Concept.html","https://support.citrix.com/article/CTX579459","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2023-4966","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2023/CVE-2023-4966.yaml","https://github.com/Chocapikk/CVE-2023-4966","https://github.com/dinosn/citrix_cve-2023-4966","https://github.com/RevoltSecurities/CVE-2023-4966","https://github.com/mlynchcogent/CVE-2023-4966-POC","https://github.com/certat/citrix-logchecker","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-4966"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0082","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0082.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-44827","title":"禅道 系统 命令执行漏洞","description":"禅道项目管理系统中存在任意代码执行漏洞。攻击者在通过身份认证后，可利用Office转换设置功能上传恶意构造的脚本，从而在服务器上执行任意系统命令，获取服务器控制权。此漏洞影响禅道社区版18.6及之前版本、企业版8.6及之前版本、旗舰版4.7及之前版本，危害极大。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2023-01c32f49","CVE-2023-44827"],"sources":["hwpoc","cve"],"published":"2023-10-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2023-10-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议升级至禅道社区版18.7及以上、企业版8.7及以上或旗舰版4.8及以上版本。若无法立即升级，应限制Office转换功能的管理后台访问权限，避免将系统暴露在公网环境。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44827","https://spotted-topaz-6aa.notion.site/Zentao-Authorized-Remote-Code-Execution-Vulnerability-CVE-2023-44827-be731cbe8607496cae35c08cb9ba2436"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0082.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0407","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0407.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-5371","title":"Wireshark RTPS 解析器内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Wireshark 4.0.0 至 4.0.8 及 3.6.0 至 3.6.16 版本的 RTPS 解析器存在内存分配大小值过大漏洞（CWE-789），同时存在资源无限制分配问题（CWE-770）。攻击者可通过向目标系统注入特制的网络数据包或提供恶意的捕获文件触发该漏洞，导致 RTPS 解析器发生内存泄漏，进而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危，影响范围较广，建议用户升级至 Wireshark 4.0.9 或 3.6.17 及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2023-5371"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-10-04T17:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:48:26Z","remediation":"升级至 Wireshark 4.0.9 及以上版本，或 3.6.17 及以上版本，该漏洞已在官方发布中修复。如无法立即升级，可在分析设置中禁用 RTPS 协议解析器作为临时缓解措施，避免打开来源不可信的抓包文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/19322","https://www.wireshark.org/security/wnpa-sec-2023-27.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/34DBP5P2RHQ7XUABPANYYMOGV5KS6VEP/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/MADSCHKZSCKQ5NLIX3UMOIJD2JZ65L4V/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202402-09","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-5371.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/5xxx/CVE-2023-5371.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-5371.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/active/CVE-2023-5371","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-5371.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-5371.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-5371.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-5371","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2023/10/GHSA-j7xf-pgw2-75mr/GHSA-j7xf-pgw2-75mr.json","https://github.com/gentoo-mirror/gentoo/blob/9ece7e5620d0e75f5e0f629df3606daa1bb7fbe4/metadata/glsa/glsa-202402-09.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0407.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0340","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-4527","title":"GNU glibc getaddrinfo 函数堆栈读取溢出漏洞","description":"GNU glibc 的 getaddrinfo 函数在处理 AF_UNSPEC 地址族查询且系统通过 /etc/resolv.conf 配置了 no-aaaa 模式时存在堆栈读取越界漏洞。当远程攻击者向目标系统发送大于 2048 字节的 TCP DNS 响应时，可触发越界堆栈读取，导致进程崩溃或泄露敏感堆栈内存数据。该漏洞影响 glibc 2.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-4527"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-09-18T17:15:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:38:01Z","remediation":"升级 glibc 至 2.37 及以上版本（各发行版对应包：Debian/Ubuntu 升级 libc6，RHEL/CentOS 升级 glibc），修复 commit 为 b327d1ef。无法立即升级时，在 /etc/resolv.conf 中移除 no-aaaa 选项，或限制 DNS TCP 响应不超过 2048 字节以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2023:5453","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2023:5455","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2023-4527","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2234712","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2023/09/25/1","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/4DBUQRRPB47TC3NJOUIBVWUGFHBJAFDL/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/DFG4P76UHHZEWQ26FWBXG76N2QLKKPZA/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce@lists.fedoraproject.org/message/NDAQWHTSVOCOZ5K6KPIWKRT3JX4RTZUR/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202310-03","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20231116-0012/","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-831302.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-4527.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/4xxx/CVE-2023-4527.json","https://github.com/openshift/openshift-docs/blob/66f2ac61aae655f47d28e3d4ea2e08fb48385535/modules/logging-rn-5.7.7.adoc","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/active/CVE-2023-4527","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/430f582ded680f823d28636f80d8cb58f1c3d8cd/2023/CVE-2023-45271.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2023-4527-2023-09-25-1805","https://github.com/flatcar/scripts/blob/0d33c8931a17f17eee34f33b0f3dc6c6b8cf35b0/changelog/security/2023-09-22-glibc-2.37-r5.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f1cf49c6d437aea92d48d4179aad183b60f4bfd9/2023/CVE-2023-4527.json","https://github.com/F5Networks/f5-ipam-controller/blob/28543a1184ec1b4348f96d17bc757d61c03ca426/docs/RELEASE-NOTES.rst","https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-common/blob/a79e47eb52c878b11564e29c0f99aa4bc52f578c/meta-common/recipes-core/glibc/glibc/CVE-2023-4527.patch","https://github.com/shoucheng3/yamcs__yamcs_CVE-2023-45277_5-8-6","https://github.com/shoucheng3/yamcs__yamcs_CVE-2023-45278_5-8-6"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0334","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0334.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-25588","title":"GNU Binutils bfd_mach_o_get_synthetic_symtab 未初始化变量导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 的 bfd_mach_o_get_synthetic_symtab 函数中存在未初始化变量漏洞，asymbol 结构体的 the_bfd 字段在未正确初始化的情况下被使用，导致程序崩溃。本地攻击者可利用特制的 Mach-O 文件触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Binutils 版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2023-25588"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-09-14T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:41:33Z","remediation":"更新 binutils 至包含 commit d12f8998d2d086f0a6606589e5aedb7147e6f2f1 的版本（≥2.40 的修复版本），或从 sourceware.org Git 仓库拉取最新源码重新编译。Red Hat 用户可通过 Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9 的 binutils 更新包获取修复，RHEL 6/7/8 用户等待厂商提供的补丁更新。NetApp 受影响产品请参考 NTAP-20231103-0003 安全通告安装对应更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2023-25588","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2167505","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20231103-0003/","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=29677","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=d12f8998d2d086f0a6606589e5aedb7147e6f2f1","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-25588.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25588.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2023-25588","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/binutils/binutils.spec","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25588.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-25588.json","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-25588.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/822347fd3caaf420e746ba3d94262f4565fb6006/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-25588.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-25588.md","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2023-25588"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0334.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0333","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-25585","title":"GNU Binutils 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 中的 `struct module *module` 结构体存在未初始化字段 (`file_table`) 漏洞（CWE-457/CWE-908）。由于 `file_table` 字段在使用前未经正确初始化，本地攻击者可通过构造特制的二进制文件，在受影响系统上触发该未初始化内存访问，导致应用程序崩溃，造成本地拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 2.40 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。建议升级至 Binutils 2.40 以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2023-25585"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-09-14T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:41:32Z","remediation":"升级 binutils 至 2.41 或更高版本，该版本已包含未初始化变量修复（提交 65cf035b）；RHEL 6/7/8 用户应安装 Red Hat 提供的对应 binutils 安全更新。如无法升级且不使用 VMS 目标支持，可在编译时通过 `--disable-targets=vms` 禁用 VMS 相关代码以规避该路径。由于该漏洞仅在处理特制 VMS 二进制文件时触发本地拒绝服务，日常使用中避免打开不可信的 VMS 格式文件也可作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2023-25585","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2167498","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20231103-0003/","https://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=29892","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=65cf035b8dc1df5d8020e0b1449514a3c42933e7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-25585.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25585.json","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/binutils/binutils.spec","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2023-25585","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25585.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-25585.json","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-25585.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/822347fd3caaf420e746ba3d94262f4565fb6006/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-25585.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-25585.md","https://github.com/OpenHD/rockchip-sdk/blob/01cc45b8cbf2a6fb6c629b287f053b667570a03a/yocto/poky/meta/recipes-devtools/binutils/binutils/0023-CVE-2023-25585.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0332","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0332.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-25584","title":"GNU Binutils bfd/vms-alpha.c parse_module 函数越界读取漏洞","description":"GNU Binutils 的 bfd/vms-alpha.c 文件中 parse_module 函数存在越界读取漏洞。攻击者可利用特制的二进制文件触发该漏洞，导致进程读取越界内存数据，可能造成信息泄露或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 GNU Binutils 相关版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。开发者已在后续版本中修复此问题，建议用户升级至安全版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2023-25584"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-09-14T21:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:41:32Z","remediation":"升级 GNU Binutils 至 2.40 及以上版本；Red Hat Enterprise Linux 用户可通过 `yum update binutils` 安装对应安全更新。NetApp 用户应参考 NTAP-20231103-0002 安装厂商补丁。临时缓解措施：避免使用存在漏洞的 binutils 版本处理不可信的 VMS Alpha 二进制文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2023-25584","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2167467","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20231103-0002/","https://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=77c225bdeb410cf60da804879ad41622f5f1aa44","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-25584.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25584.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2023-25584","https://github.com/vmware/photon/blob/0b37ad6f1c30ccbcabda429e5ce34657065d26ca/SPECS/binutils/binutils.spec","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-25584.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2023/25xxx/CVE-2023-25584.json","https://github.com/RedHatInsights/vmaas-data/blob/597797c5807d041e0799d29fdaa005763c5c07f8/csaf/2023/cve-2023-25584.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CVE-2023-25584-2024-07-31-1941","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-xilinx/blob/63094feee6c1c310f62bd3a9957a64ed52f1fdc1/meta-xilinx-core/recipes-devtools/binutils/binutils-2.43.1.inc","https://github.com/ElectricNroff/test2/blob/b264e0b0e0bee977aa036a25a79baad17899f89b/references/CVE-2023-25584-2023-11-04-0504"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0332.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0338","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-32002","title":"Node.js Module._load() 策略绕过远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Node.js 的 `Module._load()` 方法存在安全策略绕过漏洞。当实验性策略机制（policy mechanism）启用时，攻击者可通过特制的模块加载请求绕过 `policy.json` 中定义的模块白名单限制，进而加载并执行未授权的恶意模块，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Node.js 16.x、18.x 及 20.x 所有活跃发行版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-32002"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2023-08-21T17:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:57:49Z","remediation":"升级 Node.js 至安全版本：16.x 升级到 ≥16.20.1，18.x 升级到 ≥18.17.1，20.x 升级到 ≥20.5.1。如无法立即升级，可在启动脚本中移除 `--experimental-policy` 参数以禁用实验性 policy 机制作为临时缓解措施，同时审查并加强 policy.json 的路径限制规则，避免允许加载任意模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://hackerone.com/reports/1960870","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20230915-0009/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/32xxx/CVE-2023-32002.json","https://github.com/nodejs/nodejs.org/blob/2275f2